---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Sparkle & Shine Cleaning"
  description="How Sparkle & Shine Commercial / Residential Cleaning LLC collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container policy">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: September 2026</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        {site.name} ("we", "us") operates {site.url}. We provide residential and commercial cleaning services in
        {' '}{site.serviceArea}.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit our quote request form, we collect the information you provide: your name, phone number,
        email address, service address, property details, requested services, and any notes you include. If you
        call or text us, we receive your phone number.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your information solely to respond to your request, prepare your quote, schedule and deliver
        cleaning services, and communicate with you about your service. We do not sell your personal information,
        and we do not share it with third parties except the service providers needed to operate this site
        (form delivery and website hosting).
      </p>

      <h2>Form processing</h2>
      <p>
        Quote form submissions are delivered to us by Web3Forms, a form processing service. Your submission is
        transmitted securely and delivered to our business email.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies & analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not currently use advertising cookies. If we add analytics tools to understand site usage,
        this policy will be updated to describe them.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We keep quote requests and customer records only as long as needed to serve you and meet legal
        obligations. You may ask us to delete your information at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy or your data? Call us at <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .policy h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .policy h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.6rem;
  }
</style>
